  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive Education Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With a particular focus on children with disability, the initiative will: (i) enhance stakeholder capacity and service delivery at country level to ensure that inclusive education is a core part of the national education planning process and implemented in an evidence-based manner; (ii) broker knowledge and partnerships at global and country levels; and (iii) support innovation and catalytic interventions for transformative impact at the systems level</narrative>
  </description>
